## Product and capabilities
- [Courses](https://www.thinkific.com/features/courses/): Course authoring, video lessons, learning paths, quizzes, assignments, and completion certificates.
- [Learning communities](https://www.thinkific.com/features/learning-communities/): Discussion spaces, live events, and cohort interaction alongside course content.
- [Memberships](https://www.thinkific.com/features/memberships/): Recurring-revenue subscriptions and tiered access to content.
- [Digital downloads](https://www.thinkific.com/features/digital-downloads/): Selling files and digital products.
- [Coaching and webinars](https://www.thinkific.com/features/coaching-webinars/): Bookable sessions, live cohorts, and attendance tracking.
- [Thinker, the AI teaching assistant](https://www.thinkific.com/features/thinker-ai/): An in-product AI assistant that answers learners from the organization's own content. It does not draw on public internet data, and customer content is not used to train public AI models.
- [AI at Thinkific](https://www.thinkific.com/features/ai-at-thinkific/): Thinkific's stated principles for how AI is built into and used within the platform.
- [Thinkific Payments and TCommerce](https://www.thinkific.com/features/thinkific-payments/): The native commerce layer, covering flexible pricing models, global tax and payment handling, and zero transaction fees on paid plans when using TCommerce.
- [Selling tools](https://www.thinkific.com/features/selling-tools/): Coupons, promotions, affiliate tools, bundles, group licensing, and B2B invoicing.
- [Analytics and reporting](https://www.thinkific.com/features/analytics/): Program, cohort, and learner-level reporting for administrators.
- [Branded mobile app](https://www.thinkific.com/features/branded-mobile/): A white-label iOS and Android app, available as a paid add-on and included on select Plus contracts.
- [Landing pages](https://www.thinkific.com/features/landing-pages/): Site and landing-page building on a custom domain.
- [Email automation](https://www.thinkific.com/features/email-automation/): Lifecycle and marketing email built into the platform.
- [Time-saving and automation tools](https://www.thinkific.com/features/time-saving-tools/): Bulk enrollment, automation, and administrative tooling for lean teams.
- [Migrating to Thinkific Plus](https://www.thinkific.com/plus/migrate/): Migration paths for organizations moving from a legacy LMS, including SCORM content.

